  "prefLabel": "Plc 906.01 Licensee Obligations for Notifications and Updates",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 906.01 Licensee Obligations for Notifications and Updates. Each licensee shall comply with Plc 307.02 relative to required notifications, updates of contact information, and providing information on how complaints can be filed.\n\nSource. #14387, eff 10-17-25, EXPIRES: 10-17-35",
